  28:modules/oled.c **** /**
  29:modules/oled.c ****   * 数据存储格式：
  30:modules/oled.c ****   * 纵向8点，高位在下，先从左到右，再从上到下
  31:modules/oled.c ****   * 每一个Bit对应一个像素点
  32:modules/oled.c ****   * 
ARM GAS  C:\Users\LJH\AppData\Local\Temp\cccXgUgw.s 			page 2


  33:modules/oled.c ****   *      B0 B0                  B0 B0
  34:modules/oled.c ****   *      B1 B1                  B1 B1
  35:modules/oled.c ****   *      B2 B2                  B2 B2
  36:modules/oled.c ****   *      B3 B3  ------------->  B3 B3 --
  37:modules/oled.c ****   *      B4 B4                  B4 B4  |
  38:modules/oled.c ****   *      B5 B5                  B5 B5  |
  39:modules/oled.c ****   *      B6 B6                  B6 B6  |
  40:modules/oled.c ****   *      B7 B7                  B7 B7  |
  41:modules/oled.c ****   *                                    |
  42:modules/oled.c ****   *  -----------------------------------
  43:modules/oled.c ****   *  |   
  44:modules/oled.c ****   *  |   B0 B0                  B0 B0
  45:modules/oled.c ****   *  |   B1 B1                  B1 B1
  46:modules/oled.c ****   *  |   B2 B2                  B2 B2
  47:modules/oled.c ****   *  --> B3 B3  ------------->  B3 B3
  48:modules/oled.c ****   *      B4 B4                  B4 B4
  49:modules/oled.c ****   *      B5 B5                  B5 B5
  50:modules/oled.c ****   *      B6 B6                  B6 B6
  51:modules/oled.c ****   *      B7 B7                  B7 B7
  52:modules/oled.c ****   * 
  53:modules/oled.c ****   * 坐标轴定义：
  54:modules/oled.c ****   * 左上角为(0, 0)点
  55:modules/oled.c ****   * 横向向右为X轴，取值范围：0~127
  56:modules/oled.c ****   * 纵向向下为Y轴，取值范围：0~63
  57:modules/oled.c ****   * 
  58:modules/oled.c ****   *       0             X轴           127 
  59:modules/oled.c ****   *      .------------------------------->
  60:modules/oled.c ****   *    0 |
  61:modules/oled.c ****   *      |
  62:modules/oled.c ****   *      |
  63:modules/oled.c ****   *      |
  64:modules/oled.c ****   *  Y轴 |
  65:modules/oled.c ****   *      |
  66:modules/oled.c ****   *      |
  67:modules/oled.c ****   *      |
  68:modules/oled.c ****   *   63 |
  69:modules/oled.c ****   *      v
  70:modules/oled.c ****   * 
  71:modules/oled.c ****   */
  72:modules/oled.c **** 
  73:modules/oled.c **** 
